Add basic greeting function

Implements greet(name) with custom formatting and graceful empty input handling.

Contract:
- greet(name) returns "Hello, <name>!" with trimmed whitespace
- greet() / greet('') / greet('   ') returns "Hello, there!"

Tests use Node's built-in test runner (node:test + node:assert).

